{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1000_p", "source_sha256": "da0866478d363c5e0bdad94eed7e5e761ffd25ecdcab022d3dd95a063d56cfdc", "ja": "（今日はお祭りの仕事がある。志保が、みんなの\n法被を作ってきてくれた！　早速着てみよう）", "zh": "（今天有祭典的工作。志保还把大家的法被都做好带来了！赶紧穿上试试吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "a069dda2a1b9dde3e8371cea6b60f5e3d2f25c489a2a0d219f231cc55c69ceb9", "ja": "一応、完成はしたけど……はぁ。\nやっぱり、美咲さんやロコさんに任せた方が……。", "zh": "姑且算是完成了……唉。果然还是交给美咲姐和ROCO先生比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c026b9932c2a13d293d23a962479cf08dae9f3145f4461f9ea3ee09d6610aa63", "ja": "志保、お疲れさま！\nほらほら、これ見てくれ！　似合うか？", "zh": "志保，辛苦了！\n快看快看，看看这个！合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "93c46bf34e9f4f2de92d13b28d49698c1bf75763b8d82d0a475b5d6d3c3f461b", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n……ふ、ふふっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n……呵、呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1004_p", "source_sha256": "38d2032c1b55e8ddaf174d01997d377503e2e9f2ca127eae5d53737699c85e81", "ja": "え、な、なんで笑うんだ？", "zh": "咦，你、你干吗笑啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "86cd5cdf2b2eb3ee7ae89aff85ffd4e92ea0ba34b1d52c760ab2c6e38e64977c", "ja": "ふふっ、なんだか……弟を思い出してしまって。\nそんなに嬉しかったんですか？　その法被。", "zh": "呵呵……不知怎么的，让我想起弟弟了。\n有那么开心吗？因为那件法被。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e3764e2790860df2d2efaeba74567336b77512e1b9adcdabb2dab4fe4ba579ae", "ja": "そりゃ嬉しいよ。やっぱり\nお揃いの法被を着ると、お祭りって感じがしてくるし。", "zh": "那当然开心啦。果然还是要穿上同款的法披，才会有种参加祭典的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5141a0db58f79ec85a5348e61ed562a636fbeb707b82540213cb5602b1e71eb8", "ja": "それに何と言っても、志保の手作りだしな！\nいかにも手作りって感じで、味があっていい。", "zh": "而且最重要的是，这是志保亲手做的嘛！\n很有手工制作的感觉，别有一番风味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "3378cf676f228f5f867d1a2dd1398eb067b31b4dc209d53b5bba5b26fdf23226", "ja": "味……。\nそれ、遠回しに、出来が悪いって言ってませんか？", "zh": "味……。\n你的意思是，拐弯抹角地说做得很差吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a80fe2aa2b4f16c9e20061dc730df92b8e814f0225f2dac75b7321f0c96ad73e", "ja": "えっ、いや、そんな事は……！", "zh": "诶，不，没那回事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0272_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "4d80770ed015c29de8b0ff1dc965430bbd03a041a515658f2d1b9546dc8c7702", "ja": "ふふっ、冗談です。\nほら仕事、始まりますよ。行きましょう。", "zh": "呵呵，只是开个玩笑。\n好了，工作要开始了。我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
